ps://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-22","zh":"資本計畫擴張是否需要 Ameren (AEE) 投資者採取行動？"},{"title":"Ameren Illinois lineworkers earn top-10 finishes at International Rodeo","src":"WAND","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"伊利諾伊州阿梅倫線路工人在國際牛仔競技表演中獲得前十名"},{"title":"Ameren Likely to Report Q3 EPS 'Modestly Below' Consensus, BofA Securities Says","src":"Yahoo Finance","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxPQVJzYXA4ZV9LTmEtQ0RmQlRjRVlZM1BqbkhOSk1MTmw4c0M3S3hFOFhBZWRZSzdma1lrUDlwMXlJODhDTFFlNkJKSTBHejk1b3Z4UjJ2UGg0SVhhT1A3RGtQUHVYSXEtcWtoM25kWmR1Rk9qbjcxdUg2eHQwMXZKVjFEaEE1VDBXRXUtUmF5bmZMdjcxMnQ0?oc=5","date":"2026-10-21","zh":"美銀證券表示，Ameren 可能會報告第三季每股收益「略低於」共識"}],"themes":[{"name":"能源/電力","count":4},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3},{"name":"財報","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-18","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1002910/000100291026000009/aee-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Ameren, formed in 1997 and headquartered in St. Louis, Missouri, is a public utility holding company whose primary assets are its equity interests in its subsidiaries. Ameren's subsidiaries are separate, independent legal entities with separate businesses, assets, and liabilities. Dividends on Ameren's common stock and the payment of expenses by Ameren depend on distributions made to it by its subsidiaries.","zh":null},{"en":"Below is a summary description of Ameren's principal subsidiaries – Ameren Missouri, Ameren Illinois, and ATXI. Ameren also has other subsidiaries that conduct other activities, such as providing shared services. A more detailed description can be found in Note 1 – Summary of Significant Accounting Policies under Part II, Item 8, of this report.","zh":null},{"en":"Ameren Missouri operates a rate-regulated electric generation, transmission, and distribution business and a rate-regulated natural gas distribution business in Missouri.","zh":null}],"markets":[{"en":"Ameren has four segments: Ameren Missouri, Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution, Ameren Illinois Natural Gas, and Ameren Transmission. The Ameren Missouri segment includes all of the operations of Ameren Missouri. Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution consists of the electric distribution business of Ameren Illinois. Ameren Illinois Natural Gas consists of the natural gas business of Ameren Illinois. Ameren Transmission primarily consists of the aggregated electric transmission businesses of Ameren Illinois and ATXI.","zh":null},{"en":"Ameren Missouri has one segment. Ameren Illinois has three segments: Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution, Ameren Illinois Natural Gas, and Ameren Illinois Transmission.","zh":null}],"customers":[{"en":"In Illinois, while electric transmission and distribution service rates are regulated, power supply prices are not. Although electric customers are allowed to purchase power from an alternative retail electric supplier, Ameren Illinois is required to be the provider of last resort for its electric distribution customers. In 2025, 2024, and 2023, Ameren Illinois procured power on behalf of its customers for 28%, 25%, and 28%, respectively, of its total kilowatthour sales. Power purchased by Ameren Illinois for its electric distribution customers who do not elect to purchase their power from an alternative retail electric supplier comes either through procurement processes conducted by the IPA or through markets operated by the MISO. The IPA administers an RFP process through which Ameren Illinois procures its expected","zh":null}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Union Electric Company","val":4795000000,"zh":"Union Electric Company"},{"name":"Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution","val":2399000000,"zh":"Ameren Illinois Electric Distribution"},{"name":"Ameren Illinois Gas","val":968000000,"zh":"Ameren Illinois Gas"},{"name":"Ameren Transmission","val":862000000,"zh":"Ameren Transmission"}],"total":8799000000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Electricity","val":7668000000,"zh":"Electricity"},{"name":"Natural Gas Reserves","val":1131000000,"zh":"Natural Gas Reserves"}],"total":8799000000}},"peers":["DTE","CMS","AJG","CNP","ETR"]}}